      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Immediate Sale by Private 3 Bed Detached Bungalow Residence with an Extensive Range of Outbuildings standing on 1.55 acres. \r\n\r\nEligible for the Vacant Property Grant and the Derelict Top-Up Grant \r\n\r\nHeld in Part Folio LS9146"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Sitting room\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n\r\nDining room\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n\r\n3 Bedrooms\r\n\r\nUtility\r\n\r\nBack Porch\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area 80.608 sqm"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Own Well on site\r\n\r\nElectricity on site + 3 phase electricity supply available within 25 meters of the large shed. Ideal for industrial construction or development work.\r\n\r\nIncludes all outbuildings\r\n\r\nEligible for the Vacant Property Grant of €50,000 and the Derelict Top-Up Grant €70,000\r\n\r\nOld dwelling house also included in the sale together with current residence\r\n\r\nIn close proximity to schools and children’s crèche \r\n\r\n5 Minute Drive to the town of Rathdowney, Village of Errill and Killasmeestia"
      },
